<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ABACUS SAYS IN TALKS, CAUTIONS HOLDERS.</title>
<headline>ABACUS SAYS IN TALKS, CAUTIONS HOLDERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abacus Technology Holdings Ltd said on Monday it was still in talks which if succesfully concluded could impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution in their share dealings. No further details were given in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>E-mail: johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
